1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,329
Your agent keeps its place, and gets smarter every session.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,852
Cairn's Overview page, with sample data: context served.

3
00:00:10,872 --> 00:00:15,723
Agents read 19× fewer tokens than opening the files behind the answers.

4
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:23,029
New beside it: bytes pulled raw by tools. 6.5 MB across 1,284 calls.

5
00:00:23,049 --> 00:00:26,248
A measurement only. Nothing is trimmed or blocked.

6
00:00:27,048 --> 00:00:31,186
Deep into a long session, Claude Code compacts the conversation.

7
00:00:31,206 --> 00:00:35,671
Just before, Cairn's PreCompact hook saves a resume snapshot.

8
00:00:35,691 --> 00:00:41,718
Last request, files changed, open tasks, decisions. Under 2 KB.

9
00:00:41,738 --> 00:00:46,416
Pointers, not content: each line names the cairn_session_* tool to call.

10
00:00:46,436 --> 00:00:49,669
No model call. The agent picks up where it was.

11
00:00:50,469 --> 00:00:52,987
Cairn also records what not to repeat.

12
00:00:53,007 --> 00:00:58,415
Rejected approaches, error-then-fix pairs, retry loops, user corrections.

13
00:00:58,435 --> 00:01:01,982
Only explicit signals count, and no model is called.

14
00:01:02,002 --> 00:01:04,769
Next session, one search finds them.

15
00:01:05,569 --> 00:01:10,219
Memory ages. The Memory page, with sample data.

16
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:14,869
A memory no agent was told for 90 days is marked Stale and ranks lower.

17
00:01:14,889 --> 00:01:17,282
Conventions and decisions never age.

18
00:01:17,302 --> 00:01:20,778
Nothing is deleted. Being used again restarts the clock.

19
00:01:21,578 --> 00:01:25,734
Cairn. Install it once, then run cairn in your repository.
